OL,3,GNEWSAThe youth centre that's survived
OL,4,Aagainst the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortishead Youth and Community Centre
OL,7,Fis celebrating its 60th birthday this
OL,8,Fyear, but it so nearly didn't get
OL,9,Fthere.
OL,11,FThey had just completed a #1m
OL,12,Frefurbishment project when devastating
OL,13,Fnews arrived, 15 years ago.
OL,15,FThe same night they got the keys back
OL,16,Fto the building, North Somerset Council
OL,17,Ftold them it was disbanding the youth
OL,18,Fservice. Many feared the centre would
OL,19,Fnot survive.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
