OL,3,GNEWSAThe youth centre that's survived
OL,4,Aagainst the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was awful," recalls Kim Jones, the
OL,7,Fcurrent manager. "It was like the rug
OL,8,Fwas being pulled from under our feet."
